#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:808
msgid ""
"When Yablonsky SEO owns authority, membership is materialized locally and "
"updated on content/meta events. In Shadow mode background sitemap indexing is"
" paused. Old ready-state buckets stay cold; only affected buckets and the "
"root manifest are invalidated."
